사진 정보 조회:

SELECT *
FROM plant_images
ORDER BY image_id DESC;

AI 분석 결과 조회:

SELECT *
FROM ai_analysis
ORDER BY analysis_id DESC;

사진과 AI 분석 결과를 한 번에 확인:

SELECT
    p.plant_name,
    i.image_id,
    i.image_path,
    i.image_source,
    i.captured_at,
    a.leaf_status,
    a.fruit_maturity,
    a.abnormal_detected,
    a.abnormal_description,
    a.growth_metrics,
    a.confidence,
    a.analyzed_at

FROM plant_images i

JOIN plants p
    ON i.plant_id = p.plant_id

LEFT JOIN ai_analysis a
    ON i.image_id = a.image_id

ORDER BY i.captured_at DESC;
